      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it make sense to use it *ONLY* when the user is pushing to `refs/for/*`?\nA user creating a new branch won\u0027t need to spend time in this search, which would instead create unneeded workload on the Gerrit server for queries and also would add latency on the incoming receive-pack.\n\n@hiesel@google.com WYT?",
