      "writtenOn": "2024-10-01T15:07:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We could do that, but secondary index lookups are really cheap and fast, so I doubt you\u0027ll get a measurable difference from this.\n\nThe secondary index search is a little more expensive when you factor in visibility checks.\n\n@luca.milanesio@gmail.com, trace logging should show exactly how much time is spent on that index search during this operation. Are you seeing a significant enough amount of time there that you think it would be noticeable to users?",
