      "writtenOn": "2024-10-01T18:46:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I discovered this issue when improving Gerrit\u0027s performance at the Git protocol level. The interactive index thread pool was my bottleneck. Querying for open changes isn\u0027t *very* expensive, assuming that you\u0027re not under pressure. Waiting for an async operation to complete from another pool through a future, is a lot of CPU cycles :-)",
